#AREA Underdark~

#AUTHORS Jaxom Blythe~

#HELPS
-1 UNDERDARK_CHANGES~
03.18.09 - Fixed minor spelling errors. (Order)
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue that caused [*****] BUG: Mpforce - Forcing oneself: vnum 1216.
           The line was - mpforce illithid mpkill $n
           Changed to   - mpforce flayer mpkill $n
           This error also prevented the mind flayers summoned by the illithid brain
           from attacking the player.  Set mind flayers to ACT_AGGRESSIVE as a part of
           the fix. (Order)~

-1 UNDERDARK~
 {100}Underdark
---------

The Underdark is an enormous system of tunnels and caverns deep
beneath the continent of Toril with some tunnels even stretching
beyond to other continents.  Drow City is located here and while
they think they rule the Underdark, they are much mistaken.  No
one creature or race dominates here.  Rumour has it that in can be
reached through a famous tavern in Waterdeep.

(a)  {060}Blythe {100}
(b)  {050}Jaxom {100}


{a}BLYTHE
{b}JAXOM
~
0 $~

#RANGES 35 65 0 99
#MOBILES
#1200
scout drow male~
a Drow Scout~
A male drow scouts here.~
{100}He is a fairly typical male drow with ebony skin and white hair.  He wears
the piwafwi of a scout, one of the lowest ranking warriors.  He is very good
at his job however as you can barely see him hiding in the shadows.
~
