10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#1201
carrion crawler~
a Carrion Crawler~
A carrion crawler scavenges here.~
It looks like a cross between a giant green worm and a cephalopod, with
several tentacles at the mouth and dozens of legs.
~
