#1204
pech~
a Pech~
A pech works the stone here.~
He is thin with long arms and legs.  He has broad hands and feet and pale
yellowish skin beneath reddish brown hair.  You notice his eyes have no
pupils.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_INFRARED
500 S
45 BODY_LEG 0 1d1+719 1d1+29
10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>fight_prog 40~
mpecho The Pech calls upon the earth for aid!
cast earthquake $n
~
>speech_prog dirt earth~
if class($n) == 1
  if level($n) < 45
    say You seek earth from the very deep?
    mpoload 1207
    give earth $n
  endif
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if class($n) == 1
  if level($n) < 45
    mpechoat $n The pech gives you a disappointed look as he dies.
    mpechoaround $n The pech gives $n a disappointed look as he dies.
    say A fellow worshipper of the elements only had to ask and I would give!
    mpoload 1207
  endif
endif
~
|
