#1207
illithid mind flayer~
an Illithid~
A mind flayer floats here.~
It is about six feet tall with mauve skin that glistens with slime.
Its head looks like an octopus with pupilless eyes and four tentacles
around the mouth which is similar to that of a lamprey.  You notice that
it only has three fingers and a thumb on each hand.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_AGGRESSIVE|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_INFRARED
-500 S
60 BODY_LEG BODY_TENTICLE 1d1+1599 1d1+39
10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 2
  mpecho The Illithid senses you are a threat and attacks!
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>fight_prog 40~
mpechoat $n You reel back as the Illithid's mind blast burns your mind.
mpasound $n Your mind tingles from the blast of a nearby Illithid.
mpquiet on
cast 'energy drain' $n
mpquiet off
~
>death_prog 100~
mpat 1271 mpecho The illithid-brain trembles at the death of an illithid.
~
