#1212
rust monster~
a Rust Monster~
A rust monster is here.
~
It is about five feet long and three feet high.  It is armor plated
with two antennae.  It smells like wet rusted metal.
~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART
AFF_INFRARED
0 S
70 BODY_LEG BODY_TENTICLE 1d1+2799 1d1+47
10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>death_prog 50~
mpquiet on
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
cast 'remove curse' $n
mpforce $n remove armor
mpforce $n give armor rust
if hasobj(armor)
  mpjunk armor
  mpechoat $n The rust monster has eaten your armor!
else
  mpforce $n remove helm
  mpforce $n give helm rust
  if hasobj(helm)
    mpjunk helm
    mpechoat $n The rust monster has eaten your helm!
  endif
  mpquiet off
endif
~
|
