#1216
illithid brain~
the Illithid Brain~
The brain that controls all illithid is here.
~
It looks like an enormous brain with veins pulsing just under the surface.
There are hundreds of folds within its surface and it looks a bit slimy.
When you look closer at the illithid brain you can see tadpoles swimming
in the brine in which the brain lies.
~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART
AFF_INFRARED
-1000 S
70 0 0 1d1+2799 1d1+47
10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 5~
mpecho The brain pulses as it gives a command to one of its many followers.
~
>all_greet_prog 100~

  mpecho The brain calls for help as it senses your presence.
  mpmload 1207
  mpmload 1207
  mpmload 1207
  mpecho Mind Flayer reinforcements arrive and attack.
  mpforce flayer mpkill $n
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 3
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 3
  mpecho The brain collapses in on itself as it dies.
  mpoload 1202
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 4
endif
~
|
#1217
myconid leader fungus man large~
the Myconid Leader~
A large fungus man sits here.~
It resembles a walking toadstool in human form.  It is purple in color
with wide feet and stubby hands.  It is also the largest myconid you have
ever seen and the others seem to pay it a lot of respect.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_INFRARED
0 S
50 BODY_LEG 0 1d1+1039 1d1+32
10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
  if race($n) == 3
    cringe $n
  else
    say Greetings surface dweller.
    say Say that you will do me a service and I will let you live.
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes yep sure ok~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
  if race($n) == 3
    say I did not ask you drow!
    say You will pay for the transgressions of your race!
    mpkill $n
  else
    say The Illithid have encroached on our territory.
    say Eliminate them.  You may find someone that knows
    say how this may be accomplished.
    mpmset $n quest 0 3 1
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog i1202~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 4
  say You have earned your life.
  mpoload 1206
  mpoload 1205
  give i1206 $n
  give i1205 $n
  say Take these and leave us in peace.
  give i1202 $n
  say And discard of that as well.
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 5
  mpjunk all
else
  give i1202 $n
  say What do i want with that?
  mpjunk all
endif
~
|
