  say You seek to destroy the Mind Flayer's community?
  say Very well I will tell you how as it benefits all
  say denizens of the Underdark.
  mpecho The deep gnome pauses before continuing.
  say Simply kill the brain that controls them and you
  say have destroyed them all
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 2
else
