#1224
halaster mad mage~
Halaster~
The mad mage capers here.~
He is scrawny and a bit hunched over though it is hard to tell whether he
does so on purpose or is physically bent.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART AFF_INFRARED -1000 S
70 0 0 1d1+2799 1d1+47
10000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 10
  say You disturb me, $n!
  say What will it take to get rid of you?
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 11
else
  say You disturb my rest! Begone!
  mptransfer $n 1250
endif
~
>speech_prog magic mage apprentice~
if quest(3, 5, $n) == 11
  say I don't have the time for that! Here!
  mpoload 1209
  give i1209 $n
  mpoload 1210
  give i1210 $n
  mpmset $n quest 3 5 12
  say Now go!
  mptransfer $n 1200
endif
~
>fight_prog 50~
if rand(30)
  cast 'acid blast' $n
else
  if rand(30)
    cast 'energy drain'$n
  else
    if rand(30)
      cast fireball $n
    else
      cast banish $n
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
mpecho The mad mage's death causes such an explosion of magic you find
mptransfer all 1250
~
