#1201
Undermountain~
You are deep within the bowels of Mount Waterdeep, not far from the infamous
Underdark.  If I was you I wouldn't venture towards the Underdark. Only the
most evil of creatures resides there, and deep within the Underdark, lies the
city of the drow, a city of pure evil.  I would head back to the sunlit lands
above and enjoy an ale in one of the many taverns in Waterdeep.
~
